:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It sounds like an unimaginably magnificent tree.
::'''Qingque:''' Exactly, let's just say it was bigger than your imagination.
:'''Qingque:''' Anyway, it's just a legend. I see this view every day on my way to work &mdash; I'm kinda bored of it.
:'''Qingque:''' Let's go.
